 r←Test_OptionsTool_003(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;parms;globalParms;F
⍝ Exercise "OptionsTools" with just the default.
⍝ Exception: when "autoPress" is not ¯1.
 r←T._Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 globalParms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 globalParms.regKey←'MyApp\Kai1'

 parms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.OptionsTool.CreateParms
 parms.testMode←1
 parms.parent←⍎'F'⎕WC'Form'
 parms.timeout←0.1
 {}globalParms parms #.APLGUI.APLGUI.OptionsTool.Run⍕¨1000000+⍳3
 ⎕NQ parms.parent'Close'

 r←T._OK
